      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it feasible at all to remove this bit and just have us call `get_files_affected_by_patch()`? That way if `get_files_affected_by_patch()` changes for w/e reason, `get_files_affected_by_patch_with_submodules()` gets that picked up automatically.",
